(candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha) - already? origin_availability_alpha not prepared initially; we need to prepare it.

(candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta) - not prepared initially; need to prepare shift_candidate_beta.

(candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha) - need to attach task profile to shift_candidate_beta.

(candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_beta vehicle_unit_gamma) - need to allocate vehicle unit gamma to shift_candidate_beta (or link vehicle). Currently shift_candidate_beta vehicle not allocated; but we have vehicle_unit_gamma available? Not yet allocated to anyone. We need to allocate vehicle to shift_candidate_beta and link.

