- destination_availability_alpha: candidate_created true, vehicle_allocated true (vehicle_unit_beta), candidate_destination_availability_linked shift_candidate_alpha and shift_candidate_beta.

- shift_candidate_beta: candidate_created true, candidate_origin_availability_linked origin_availability_alpha, candidate_destination_availability_linked destination_availability_alpha, candidate_transport_leg_linked transport_leg_alpha, candidate_loading_container_linked loading_container_beta, candidate_operational_constraint_linked operational_constraint_beta.

- No operator linked to origin/destination/shift_candidate_beta yet.

- No task profile linked to any.

- No loading containers loaded.

- No nodes ready/occupied.

